##### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
##### Template file – safe to commit.
##### Copy this to .env and fill in your real values for local development.
##### For GitHub Actions, add each key as a Secret in:
#####   Repo → Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions → New repository secret
#####
##### GitHub Secrets checklist for this app/workflow:
#####   1) TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN   (required)
#####   2) TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID     (required)
#####   3) DISPLAY_TIMEZONE     (optional, default Asia/Kolkata)
#####   4) ALERT_MESSAGE_TEMPLATE (optional)
#####   5) MANUAL_TEST_MESSAGE_TEMPLATE (optional)
#####
##### Workflow schedule reference (IST, Mon-Fri):
#####   - 10:07 AM IST
#####   - 12:38 PM IST
#####   - 02:54 PM IST
##### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

##### Telegram credentials (required)
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=

##### Timezone for message timestamps (optional)
DISPLAY_TIMEZONE=Asia/Kolkata

##### Manual test mode (optional)
MANUAL_TEST_MODE=false

##### Message templates (optional)
ALERT_MESSAGE_TEMPLATE=📈 Market ping at {actual_run_time} ({display_timezone})
MANUAL_TEST_MESSAGE_TEMPLATE=🧪 Manual test ping at {actual_run_time} ({display_timezone})


